{%- comment -%}
  Flash sale mode (Theme settings > Flash sale) swaps the header bars:
  on  = the flash countdown bar shows and the regular announcement bar hides
  off = the regular announcement bar shows and the countdown bar hides
  The countdown bar is the "SS - Sticky countdown bar" in the Header group.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  {%- if settings.rl_flash_mode -%}
    .shopify-section-group-header-group:has(.announcement-bar) {
      display: none !important;
    }
  {%- else -%}
    [id$='__ss_sticky_countdown_kUiAhh'] {
      display: none !important;
    }
  {%- endif -%}
</style>
